{
  "name": "CokeAI｜zyanai 商品镜像同步（每 6 小时）",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## zyanai 商品镜像同步\n\n每 6 小时拉取 zyanai.cc 公开商品列表与详情，更新小店的商品标题、介绍、价格和库存状态。\n\n- 缺货商品自动隐藏，补货自动恢复上架\n- 售价按拿货价 ÷ 0.7 重算，价格变动写入历史\n- 只同步商品，订单仍由人工采购，不触发任何下单\n- 单款抓取失败保留旧内容，结果写入 shop_sync_runs\n\n手动：后台脚本 `docker compose exec app node zyanai-sync.mjs`，或带 secret 调 `POST /api/internal/shop/zyanai-sync`。",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "e2b1c3d4-5f60-4a71-8b82-a3c4d5e6f001",
      "name": "使用说明",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "41 */6 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "e2b1c3d4-5f60-4a71-8b82-a3c4d5e6f002",
      "name": "每 6 小时 :41",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://app:3000/api/internal/shop/zyanai-sync",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "x-internal-secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_SECRET }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
